// cppcheck suppression file for tcl-lsp C++ code.
// Suppress pybind11 binding noise — those files are shim code.
*:native/bindings/*
// Suppress Catch2 / subproject noise.
*:subprojects/*
// missingIncludeSystem: we don't need cppcheck to verify system headers exist.
missingIncludeSystem
// unusedFunction: public API used from pybind11 bindings and tests, not visible
// to cppcheck when scanning only the source directory.
unusedFunction
// shadowFunction: local variables caching member state in hot loops intentionally
// shadow public accessor methods (e.g., local `pos` vs `pos()` accessor).
shadowFunction
// redundantAssignment: backslash-newline continuation intentionally reassigns col
// after incrementing it (the increment was for the backslash, the reset for newline).
redundantAssignment:native/src/parsing/lexer.cpp
// unmatchedSuppression: wildcard suppressions for bindings/subprojects above.
unmatchedSuppression
